### 4.3 Critical Edge Cases That Will Break the System

| Edge Case | Expected Behavior | Actual Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| Hindi/Bengali/Tamil emergency message | Emergency response | LLM generates general health response |
| 50,000 character input message | Reject with 400 | Passes to LLM, burns tokens, may error |
| Emoji-only message: "💊💊💊" | `"Please type a message"` | Passes to classifier, intent="other" or crashes |
| Simultaneous identical queries (10 users) | Cache hit on 2nd+ | Different Gunicorn workers, different hash() values = 10 LLM calls |
| OpenRouter API down | Graceful fallback message | ✅ Already handled (returns friendly error) |
| Pinecone cold start (index not responding) | Graceful fallback | ✅ Already handled |
| User uploads a polyglot image (valid PNG but contains malicious HTML) | Rejected | ⚠️ Pillow verifies image integrity but not polyglot content |
| Very short query: "ok" or "hi" | Should route to `greeting` intent | TF-IDF too sparse for 1-2 word inputs |
| Null byte injection in `msg` field | Should sanitize | Not tested |

