### Step 3 — Gunicorn Performance Upgrade

**Change `gunicorn.conf.py`:**

```python
# Before
worker_class = "sync"
threads = 1

# After
worker_class = "gevent"        # async I/O — handles LLM waits efficiently
threads = 1
worker_connections = 1000      # per gevent worker
```

**Add to `requirements.txt`:**
```
gevent>=23.9.1
```

This change alone will increase your concurrent user capacity from ~4 to ~400+.

