### Step 7 — UX/UI Upgrades for Production Trust

#### 7a. Mandatory Consent Modal (Legal Requirement)

Add to `chat.html` — fires on first visit (stored in `localStorage`):

```html
<div id="consent-modal" class="modal-overlay">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <h2>⚕️ Before You Begin</h2>
    <p>MediBot provides <strong>general health information only</strong>. 
       It is NOT a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
       Do not enter personally identifiable health information.</p>
    <p>By continuing, you agree to our 
       <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> and 
       <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="consent-check"> 
      I understand MediBot is an AI assistant, not a doctor.
    </label>
    <button id="consent-btn" disabled>Start Chat</button>
  </div>
</div>
```

#### 7b. Streaming Responses (Latency UX)

The biggest UX problem is that users see nothing for 5–15 seconds while the LLM generates a response. Implement streaming:

```python
# app.py — Add streaming route
from flask import stream_with_context, Response

@app.route("/get/stream", methods=["POST"])
def chat_stream():
    msg = request.form.get("msg", "").strip()[:2000]
    
    def generate():
        for chunk in _rag_chain.stream({"input": msg}):
            yield chunk.get("answer", "")
    
    return Response(stream_with_context(generate()), 
                   mimetype="text/event-stream")
```

#### 7c. Required UI Additions

| Feature | Priority | Implementation |
|---|---|---|
| Consent modal on first visit | 🔴 Legal | `localStorage` flag + modal |
| Typing indicator (animated dots) | 🔴 UX | CSS animation, show during fetch |
| Streaming response | 🔴 UX | SSE endpoint + JS EventSource |
| "This is AI, not a doctor" persistent banner | 🔴 Legal | Pinned top bar |
| Emergency phone numbers always visible | 🔴 Safety | Sidebar or footer |
| Message copy button | 🟡 UX | Clipboard API |
| Conversation history sidebar | 🟡 UX | Requires login |
| Export my data button | 🟡 Legal/DPDP | ZIP of user's conversations |
| Delete my account button | 🔴 DPDP/GDPR | Hard delete endpoint |
| Dark mode | 🟢 UX | CSS variables already structured for it |

