## Summary Scorecard

| Category | Score | Key Issue |
|---|---|---|
| **Security** | 4/10 | API keys in git, no CSP, open redirect, CSRF missing |
| **Architecture** | 6/10 | Sync workers, hash() cache key, memory rate limiter |
| **Code Quality** | 7/10 | Generally clean; hash bug and secret key fallback are critical |
| **Prompt Safety** | 5/10 | No post-gen guardrail, injection via vision prompt possible |
| **Test Coverage** | 3/10 | ~35% coverage, zero integration tests for RAG pipeline |
| **Compliance** | 2/10 | No consent modal, no data deletion, no audit log |
| **Observability** | 4/10 | Basic logging only; no APM, no alerting |
| **Deployment** | 6/10 | Good Docker/Nginx setup; SQLite and sync workers block scale |
| **UX** | 5/10 | No streaming, no typing indicator, no disclaimer banner |

**Overall Production Readiness: ⚠️ 4.5/10 — Not safe for open-internet deployment yet.**

